[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-08): `plasma-workspace-libs`'s closure from v3.23 installed and
asked at a later version. The installed `icu-data-full` provides
`icu-data` at its version and is needed by the installed `qt6-qt5compat`
by name alone. The request reaches `icu-libs`, which needs `icu-data` at
the later version exactly; apk upgrades `icu-data-full` to it. The
constraint is required through names each with a single candidate before
`icu-libs` is installed
(`installed/a-sole-candidate-s-constraint-upgrades-an-installed-package`).

